00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.380
A nostalgic machine.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.930
Yes. It was your machine, wasn't it?

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.550
Indeed.

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:43.180
But there's something that worries me.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:47.270
The report states that the Gundams will be under the control of

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:50.980
Captain Girard Spriggan, a Federation ace pilot.

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:52.730
Who gave such a stupid order?

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:55.190
I'll discuss this when we reach the moon.

00:18:55.190 --> 00:19:01.240
Perhaps the Federation Forces have finally realized the value of the Gundam and the AGE System.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.210
It's finally time to return to space, isn't it?

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.920
I don't want to.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:17.670
But you don't want to live peacefully on Earth either, right?

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:33.860
Kio.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:37.480
Grandpa...

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:42.280
Grandpa!

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:47.790
What happened with Shanalua wasn't your fault.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:52.620
And even if she survived, she would've been executed for her crimes. {gets capital punishment/ie death sentence}

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:55.710
But... Ms. Shanalua was our comrade, wasn't she?

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:59.880
Kio, this is what war is.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:01.630
Grandpa...

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:06.220
It's so sad... But we have to fight anyway?

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:09.930
Listen.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:13.350
To protect everyone from sadness, we have to fight.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:16.520
That is the mission of a Gundam pilot.

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:17.520
Grandpa...

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:22.740
Come on, we're getting ready to launch.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:32.330
Lord Ezelcant, I'd like to ask you something.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:33.750
<i>What is it?</i>

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:37.250
It seems as if you're giving the Earthers a reprieve.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.000
Testing them.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.300
Why would you do such a thing?

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:45.970
Zeheart. I am always thinking of Vagan.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:48.760
Need I say more?

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:49.760
No, sir.

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:57.940
Who's there?

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:02.030
Fram Nara.

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:06.200
I've been sent from Second Moon to participate in Project Eden.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.910
I've heard nothing of this.

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:11.370
Master Zanald said I was to support you.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.910
That meddling...

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:17.040
Sorry, I don't need any help.

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:26.380
Zeheart Galette...

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.430
How much of a man is he?{just bring romary and we can have a massive NTRfest}

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:34.270
Switch from external to internal power is completed.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.560
Commencing automatic countdown sequence.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:39.270
300 seconds until Diva lift off.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:44.110
<i>Commander, we'll begin a decoy 
operation to secure the Diva's target orbit.</i>

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:50.030
<i>While we draw away the nearby enemy, please transfer the Diva to lunar orbit.</i>

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:51.450
Understood.

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:55.330
But I never thought Vagan would seize control of Earth orbit.

00:21:55.330 --> 00:21:57.000
It's worse than that.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:22:01.670
40% of Earth's surface is now under Vagan control.

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:03.960
I had no idea the enemy was so strong.

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:07.550
The real battle is just beginning.

